    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a distant subject to me. I prefer biology and art, where creativity flows naturally. Math is something I need to pass, not something I enjoy. It's logical and rigid, which clashes with my more intuitive thinking style. Still, I understand its importance, especially for my future career and everyday problem-solving.",
